{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a small responsive **handwritten statement section** for the DocMed About Us page based on the attached visual reference.
    
    The purpose of this section is to create a short, emotional visual break between larger content sections.
    
    ### Content
    
    Default German text:
    
    **Gesundheit
    kennt keine Grenzen.**
    
    The text must be completely editable through the Shopify Theme Editor and must support Shopify's normal storefront translations.
    
    For the English storefront, I want to be able to display:
    
    **Health
    knows no borders.**
    
    Do **not** hard-code the German text into the design, an image, SVG or CSS.
    
    The statement must be rendered as actual HTML text so that different translations can be displayed depending on the storefront language.
    
    ### Design
    
    The statement should look like a **natural handwritten signature/message**, similar to the attached reference.
    
    Use:
    
    * Elegant handwritten/script typography
    * DocMed dark blue/navy
    * Slightly informal but professional handwriting
    * Generous whitespace around the statement
    * No background image
    * No card
    * No border
    * No button
    
    The text should feel like a small personal statement rather than a normal website headline.
    
    ### Underline
    
    Add a subtle handwritten-style curved underline underneath the statement, similar to the reference.
    
    The underline should be decorative only.
    
    It can be implemented as:
    
    * SVG
    * CSS
    * Another lightweight responsive solution
    
    The underline must automatically adapt to the width of the statement and should not contain any text.
    
    ### Alignment
    
    On desktop, center the statement horizontally within the page.
    
    The overall content should remain relatively compact and should **not span the entire width of the page**.
    
    Example visual structure:
    
    ```
                    Gesundheit
                  kennt keine Grenzen.
                       _______
    ```
    
    The handwriting can have a slight natural angle/variation similar to the reference, but readability is more important than perfectly reproducing real handwriting.
    
    ### Responsive behavior
    
    The section must be fully responsive.
    
    **Desktop**
    
    * Large handwritten statement
    * Centered horizontally
    * Generous whitespace above and below
    * Maximum width approximately 500–650 px
    
    **Tablet**
    
    * Reduce font size proportionally
    * Maintain centered alignment
    * Keep the underline positioned correctly
    
    **Mobile**
    
    * Statement remains centered
    * Font size scales down automatically
    * Allow a natural two-line layout
    * Do not allow individual words to be awkwardly clipped
    * Underline scales proportionally
    * Reduce vertical padding
    * No horizontal scrolling
    
    Use responsive typography with `clamp()` where appropriate instead of multiple hard-coded font sizes.
    
    ### IMPORTANT – Multilingual support
    
    This section must work correctly with the multilingual Shopify storefront.
    
    The text must be translatable using Shopify's translation system / Translate & Adapt.
    
    Example:
    
    German:
    **Gesundheit kennt keine Grenzen.**
    
    English:
    **Health knows no borders.**
    
    Do not create separate German and English sections.
    
    Use **one section with translatable text content**, so Shopify automatically displays the correct translation depending on the selected storefront language.
    
    The line break should ideally remain controllable through the text setting or adapt naturally depending on the translation.
    
    ### Shopify Theme Editor
    
    Create editable settings for:
    
    * Statement text
    * Text color
    * Font size
    * Font / handwriting style if technically possible
    * Maximum width
    * Alignment
    * Underline on/off
    * Underline color
    * Section top padding
    * Section bottom padding
    
    Use an available handwritten/script web-safe or theme-compatible font. Do not load an unnecessarily large external font library solely for this section.
    
    The final result should feel **personal, human and understated**, providing a visual contrast to the more structured corporate sections of the DocMed About Us page.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .ai-statement-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-statement__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: {{ block.settings.alignment }}; }
  .ai-statement__text-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin: 0; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; font-family: {{ block.settings.handwriting_font.family }}, cursive; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, {{ block.settings.font_size }}px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.025em; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: normal; }
  .ai-statement__text-{{ ai_gen_id }} p { margin: 0; }
  .ai-statement__underline-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; width: min(78%, 390px); height: auto; margin: 12px auto 0; color: {{ block.settings.underline_color }}; }
  .ai-statement__underline-{{ ai_gen_id }} path { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-width: 2.2; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) { .ai-statement-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-right: 16px; padding-left: 16px; } .ai-statement__text-{{ ai_gen_id }} { font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 10vw, {{ block.settings.font_size }}px); } .ai-statement__underline-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: min(84%, 300px); margin-top: 9px; } }
{% endstyle %}
<div class="ai-statement-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-statement__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-statement__text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.statement_text }}</div>
    {% if block.settings.show_underline %}<svg class="ai-statement__underline-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 400 38" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M8 18 C62 30, 111 25, 165 17 S271 4, 323 16 C350 22, 373 23, 392 15"></path></svg>{% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Handwritten statement","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"Statement"},{"type":"richtext","id":"statement_text","label":"Text","default":"<p>Gesundheit<br>kennt keine Grenzen.</p>"},{"type":"font_picker","id":"handwriting_font","label":"Handwriting font","default":"serif"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text color","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"range","id":"font_size","label":"Font size","min":40,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":70},{"type":"range","id":"max_width","label":"Maximum width","min":300,"max":650,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":560},{"type":"select","id":"alignment","label":"Alignment","options":[{"value":"left","label":"Left"},{"value":"center","label":"Center"},{"value":"right","label":"Right"}],"default":"center"},{"type":"header","content":"Underline"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_underline","label":"Show underline","default":true},{"type":"color","id":"underline_color","label":"Underline color","default":"#1D2E40"},{"type":"header","content":"Spacing"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"padding_top","label":"Top padding","min":20,"max":140,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"padding_bottom","label":"Bottom padding","min":20,"max":140,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80}],"presets":[{"name":"Handwritten statement"}],"tag":null,"class":"handwritten-statement-block"}
{% endschema %}